<title>AUSTRALIA: Porgera gold output up in nine months-Goldfields.</title>
<headline>Porgera gold output up in nine months-Goldfields.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold production at the giant Porgera gold mine in Papua New Guinea rose to 696,232 ounces in the nine months ended March 31 from 645,183 ounces a year earlier, Goldfields Ltd reported on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
